stion-1746689335391\",\"name\":\"How does Google Ads work?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"By using Google Ads, marketers can bid on profitable keywords, and Google will show their ads based on relevance, quality score, and bid amount.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/google-ads\/#faq-question-1714828546632\",\"position\":4,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/google-ads\/#faq-question-1714828546632\",\"name\":\"How do I use Google Ads to my advantage?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"- Reach your marketing goals<br\/>- Target your ads with keywords<br\/>- Get specific about your target audience<br\/>- Only pay for results<br\/>- Measure your ad's performance<br\/>- Advertise across platforms\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/google-ads\/#faq-question-1714828586858\",\"position\":5,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/google-ads\/#faq-question-1714828586858\",\"name\":\"What is the minimum time required on Google Ads?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"At least 30 minutes per week are recommended to review the ad results and make required adjustments.\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/google-ads\/#faq-question-1714828595652\",\"position\":6,\"url\":\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/google-ads\/#faq-question-1714828595652\",\"name\":\"Can I goal distinct places with Google Ads?\",\"answerCount\":1,\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, Google Ads allows advertisers to target unique geographic locations, from countries and regions to towns and neighborhoods.<br\/>\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"@id\":